    "CoiStatement": "Compliance with Ethical Standards Competing interests SvdS has no competing interests. JvB, JK and MJP are employed at the University of Groningen, which has received research grants from Boehringer Ingelheim, AstraZeneca and GlaxoSmithKline, all manufacturers of some of the respiratory drugs described in this article. JK has received several research grants and has been paid for consultancy services by AstraZeneca, Boehringer Ingelheim, GlaxoSmithKline and Novartis, companies that produce drugs reviewed in this paper. MJP has received grants and honoraria from various pharmaceutical companies, including those developing, producing and marketing COPD drugs. MRM, LG and MB are employed by the Erasmus University Rotterdam, which has received research grants from Boehringer Ingelheim, GlaxoSmithKline, Novartis, AstraZeneca, Chiesi, and Almirall, manufacturers of respiratory drugs. Funding No funding was received for this study.",
    "Article": {
